---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import siteData from "../../content/site.json";
const service = siteData.services.styleBundles;
---
<BaseLayout title="Style bundles" description="Tell Sage what you are into and let her build a secondhand style bundle around you.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">A thrift haul built around one person</span>
    <h1>Style bundles</h1>
    <p>You bring the sizes, references, budget, and honest opinions. Sage does the searching and puts the pieces together.</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href={siteData.business.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Start with a message</a>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section bundle-intake-grid">
    <div class="bundle-moodboard" aria-label="Information Sage uses to build a style bundle">
      <div class="mood-tile mood-tile-one"><span>sizes + fit</span></div>
      <div class="mood-tile mood-tile-two"><span>colors</span></div>
      <div class="mood-tile mood-tile-three"><span>inspiration</span></div>
      <div class="mood-tile mood-tile-four"><span>hard no's</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="bundle-intake-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">What to send Sage</span>
      <h2>The more honest you are, the better the bundle gets.</h2>
      <ul class="plain-checklist">
        {service.confirmedInputs.map((input) => <li>{input}</li>)}
        <li>Anything you already own too much of</li>
        <li>What you actually want the clothes for</li>
      </ul>
      <blockquote>“I love this vibe, but I would never wear that color” is useful information.</blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section bundle-process-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">From the first message to mail day</span>
        <h2>How a bundle comes together</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <ol class="editorial-process">
      {service.process.map((step, index) => (
        <li><span>0{index + 1}</span><p>{step}</p></li>
      ))}
    </ol>
    <div class="soft-note">
      <strong>Past bundles have started around ${service.startingPrice}.</strong>
      <p>The final price depends on the number of pieces, the budget, and what Sage can realistically source. She confirms that before she begins.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
